      "label": "The takeaway",
      "kicker": "11 · Read the role, not only the shape",
      "title": "A boundary is meaningful only when its purpose travels with it",
      "text": "Canada can be compared nationally only by carrying role, type, source, and reference date beside every feature. The map is therefore an atlas of related systems—not a claim that one hierarchy governs the whole country.",
